@sources_membership
new-page: true

= **Party membership**

Membership figures for 1945-1970 shown in the statistics card. Only the yearly figures are historical: the monthly ups and downs between them (election campaigns, seasonal changes and other swings) are invented to make the chart readable.

1960, 1965 and 1970, all four parties: Folketingets Oplysning, 'Partiernes medlemstal fra 1960' (updated December 2025), based on Bille, Lars. 'Partiet i forandring'. Odense Universitetsforlag, 1997.

Socialdemokratiet 1945-1957: Delwit (below).

Venstre 1950: about 200,000 members, from 'Venstre', Lex. https://lex.dk/Venstre

The other pre-1960 values for Venstre, the Conservatives and Radikale Venstre are the author's estimates.

Delwit, Pascal. 'The Socialist Family'. Université libre de Bruxelles. Table 1: Number of members of social democrat parties in Sweden, Denmark and Norway. https://dipot.ulb.ac.be/dspace/bitstream/2013/286131/3/DELWITSocialistfamily.pdf

Bille, Lars. 'Den danske partimodels forfald?'. Chapter 1, figure 1.1: Medlemsudviklingen 1935-2000. https://unipress.dk/media/12040/9788779340596_excerpt.pdf

'Socialdemokratiet, 1871-'. Danmarkshistorien, Lex. https://danmarkshistorien.lex.dk/Socialdemokratiet,_1871-

'Socialdemokratiets historie (1871 - ca. 1990), Del 3'. Fynhistorie. https://fynhistorie.dis-danmark.dk/node/5697

