= **Economy**

GDP, exports and other macroeconomic figures: The World Bank, Denmark. https://data.worldbank.org/country/denmark

Exports as a share of GDP: The World Bank. https://data.worldbank.org/indicator/NE.EXP.GNFS.ZS?locations=DK

Savings, consumption and imports: Statistikbanken, Danmarks Statistik. https://www.statistikbanken.dk

Income shares: World Inequality Database, Denmark. https://wid.world

